name: sim.getJointTargetForce
description: Retrieves the force or torque that a joint can exert
luaSynopsis: float forceOrTorque = sim.getJointTargetForce(int jointHandle)
pythonSynopsis: float forceOrTorque = sim.getJointTargetForce(int jointHandle)
inputs:
1. jointHandle: handle of the joint
outputs:
1. forceOrTorque: the maximum force or torque the joint can apply. The sign indicates the desired movement direction
replacedBy:
- name: targetForce, class: joint, file: joint_targetForce.property
